  "checks": [
    "The previous lock digest of each profile equals the kernelMirror.lockSha256 approved by mesh-vertex-stride.json (reviewedLockSha256 there).",
    "kernelmirror diff of the previous lock against the integrated lock lists every pre-existing light/mesher/noise/worldgen method as UNCHANGED and only ore methods as SIGNATURE (added).",
    "The kernelSemantics block of the lock is identical before and after; only the manifest hash and the appended ore methods differ.",
    "Each ore method hash is computed by ClassHasher.java from the local named client jar listed per profile with -Xmx3g.",
    "The independent ASM oracle of the real OreFeature replays 99,873 paired geometry + delta cases (41,832 / 41,824 / 16,217) byte for byte on native, wasm baseline and wasm SIMD.",
    "kernelmirror generate --check, gate --check, test-kernelmirror.mjs, kernel-mirror-smoke.mjs and profilegen --check pass on the integrated tree."
  ],
